   "title": "Note: FastH3 image to video",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## FastH3 4-step (VSA), image to video with sound\n\nMiniMax H3 distilled to 4 steps by FastVideo; ComfyUI conversion by Kijai.\n\nAiLabor Art Studio puts the approved picture into **Load Image -> first_frame** and writes the motion prompt, so this file is used as-is. Needs **16-24 GB of VRAM**; a 10-second 640 x 640 clip takes about 90 s on an RTX 3090.\n\n**Keep these as they are (inside the subgraph):** 4 steps, euler, simple, CFG 1, sigma shift 12 / 3, Block Sparse Attention **vsa** with start_percent 0."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## FastH3 4-step (VSA), image to video with sound\n\nMiniMax H3 distilled to 4 steps by FastVideo; ComfyUI conversion by Kijai.\n\nAiLabor Art Studio puts the approved picture into **Load Image -> first_frame** and writes the motion prompt, so this file is used as-is. Needs **16-24 GB of VRAM**; a 10-second 640 x 640 clip takes about 90 s on an RTX 3090.\n\n**Keep these as they are (inside the subgraph):** 4 steps, euler, simple, CFG 1, sigma shift 12 / 3, Block Sparse Attention **vsa** with start_percent 0."
   },
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000"
  },
